## What Stays, What Changes, What Gets Added

### Keep (Working Correctly)
| Component | Reason |
|-----------|--------|
| Multi-call architecture | Correct for small models |
| ToolPolicy registry | Good failure routing without LLM |
| run_controller (abort/pause/resume) | Solid, keep as-is |
| task_store.py | Task persistence, needs more use |
| NEED_INPUT pause/resume | Critical, working |
| Idempotency (seen_calls set) | Prevents duplicate side effects |
| SSE streaming to UI | Good UX |
| SANDBOX file isolation | Clean pattern |
| model_adapter fallback chain | Fine for free-tier local use |

### Change (Fix These)
| Component | Change |
|-----------|--------|
| ACT prompt | Cut from ~4000 to ~700 tokens. Remove SOUL/USER/full memory/full history |
| PLAN prompt | Cut from ~2000 to ~1200 tokens |
| Output format | 6 options → 3 options (TOOL / DONE / NEED) |
| Tool schema injection | Whole category → predicted 1 tool + 1 backup |
| REPLAN trigger | Only on 3+ consecutive failures, not 1 |
| SYNTHESIS | Skip for single-step + all-succeeded tasks |
| system_prompt | Dynamic bloat → 5 fixed lines |
| Memory injection | Whole file → 5 keyword-matched items |

### Add (Missing Features)
| Feature | Priority |
|---------|----------|
| workflow.save / workflow.run / workflow.list tools | 🔴 High — core goal |
| Auto-trigger from workflow library | 🔴 High |
| Workflow suggestion after successful multi-step task | 🟡 Medium |
| Native Ollama tool-calling for supported models | 🟡 Medium |
| SOUL.md injection only in CHAT mode, not execution | 🟢 Low effort |

